{"tag":"section","attrib":{"id":"id5d1fa993-86b3-11f1-aae1-ab9d2cf5dce1","identifier":"/us/usc/t12/s374"},"text":null,"children":[{"tag":"num","attrib":{"value":"374"},"text":"§ 374.","children":[],"tail":null},{"tag":"heading","attrib":{},"text":" Acting as agent for nonmember bank in getting discounts from reserve bank","children":[],"tail":null},{"tag":"content","attrib":{},"text":"\n","children":[{"tag":"p","attrib":{},"text":"No member bank shall act as the medium or agent of a nonmember bank in applying for or receiving discounts from a Federal reserve bank under the provisions of this chapter, except by permission of the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System.","children":[],"tail":"\n"}],"tail":null},{"tag":"sourceCredit","attrib":{"id":"id5d1fa994-86b3-11f1-aae1-ab9d2cf5dce1"},"text":"(","children":[{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/act/1913-12-23/ch6/s19/e"},"text":"Dec. 23, 1913, ch. 6, § 19(e)","children":[],"tail":", formerly § 19 (par. 8), "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/stat/38/270"},"text":"38 Stat. 270","children":[],"tail":"; "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/act/1917-06-21/ch32/s10"},"text":"June 21, 1917, ch. 32, § 10","children":[],"tail":", "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/stat/40/239"},"text":"40 Stat. 239","children":[],"tail":"; "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/act/1935-08-23/ch614"},"text":"Aug. 23, 1935, ch. 614","children":[],"tail":", title II, § 203(a), "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/stat/49/704"},"text":"49 Stat. 704","children":[],"tail":"; renumbered § 19(e), "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/pl/89/597/s2/b"},"text":"Pub. L. 89–597, § 2(b)","children":[],"tail":", "},{"tag":"date","attrib":{"date":"1966-09-21"},"text":"Sept. 21, 1966","children":[],"tail":", "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/stat/80/824"},"text":"80 Stat. 824","children":[],"tail":".)"}],"tail":"\n"},{"tag":"notes","attrib":{"type":"uscNote","id":"id5d1fa995-86b3-11f1-aae1-ab9d2cf5dce1"},"text":"\n","children":[{"tag":"note","attrib":{"role":"crossHeading","topic":"editorialNotes","id":"id5d1fa996-86b3-11f1-aae1-ab9d2cf5dce1"},"text":null,"children":[{"tag":"heading","attrib":{},"text":null,"children":[{"tag":"b","attrib":{},"text":"Editorial Notes","children":[],"tail":null}],"tail":null}],"tail":"\n"},{"tag":"note","attrib":{"topic":"referencesInText","id":"id5d1fa997-86b3-11f1-aae1-ab9d2cf5dce1"},"text":"\n","children":[{"tag":"heading","attrib":{},"text":"References in Text","children":[],"tail":null},{"tag":"p","attrib":{},"text":"This chapter, referred to in text, was in the original “this Act”, meaning ","children":[{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/act/1913-12-23/ch6"},"text":"act Dec. 23, 1913, ch. 6","children":[],"tail":", "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/stat/38/251"},"text":"38 Stat. 251","children":[],"tail":", known as the Federal Reserve Act. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see References in Text note set out under "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/usc/t12/s226"},"text":"section 226 of this title","children":[],"tail":" and Tables."}],"tail":"\n"}],"tail":"\n"},{"tag":"note","attrib":{"topic":"codification","id":"id5d221a98-86b3-11f1-aae1-ab9d2cf5dce1"},"text":null,"children":[{"tag":"heading","attrib":{},"text":"Codification","children":[],"tail":"\n"},{"tag":"p","attrib":{},"text":"Section is comprised of part of subsec. (e), formerly eighth par., of section 19 of act ","children":[{"tag":"date","attrib":{"date":"1913-12-23"},"text":"Dec. 23, 1913","children":[],"tail":", as redesignated by "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/pl/89/597"},"text":"Pub. L. 89–597","children":[],"tail":". Remainder of subsec. (e) of such section 19 is classified to "},{"tag":"ref","attrib":{"href":"/us/usc/t12/s463"},"text":"section 463 of this title","children":[],"tail":"."}],"tail":"\n"}],"tail":"\n"},{"tag":"note","attrib":{"role":"crossHeading","topic":"statutoryNotes","id":"id5d221a99-86b3-11f1-aae1-ab9d2cf5dce1"},"text":null,"children":[{"tag":"heading","attrib":{},"text":null,"children":[{"tag":"b","attrib":{},"text":"Statutory Notes and Related Subsidiaries","children":[],"tail":null}],"tail":null}],"tail":"\n"},{"tag":"note","attrib":{"topic":"changeOfName","id":"id5d221a9a-86b3-11f1-aae1-ab9d2cf5dce1"},"text":"\n","children":[{"tag":"heading","attrib":{},"text":"Change of Name","children":[],"tail":"\n"},{"tag":"p","attrib":{},"text":"Section 203(a) of act ","children":[{"tag":"date","attrib":{"date":"1935-08-23"},"text":"Aug. 23, 1935","children":[],"tail":", changed name of Federal Reserve Board to Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System."}],"tail":"\n"}],"tail":"\n"}],"tail":"\n"}],"tail":null}
